/* ============================== The truck on the RO (Parsec 9.7) ==============================
   A picture of the truck in the RO's header (a band across the top, the truck on the right) and in
   the RO list. Which picture: the model picture for the truck's year and model; if there isn't one,
   the check-in photo — the first picture in the RO's Pictures (taken on the phone or the computer);
   if there's neither, a plain outline. Model pictures live with the shop's data (Your data › Truck
   pictures); add one from any RO that has none. */
